{% if skills %}
<SKILLS>
A skill is a set of instructions for one kind of task. It is not a tool:
you cannot call it by name.

<available_skills>
{% for skill in skills %}
- `{{ skill.name }}`: {{ skill.description }}
{% endfor %}
</available_skills>

<how_to_use>
1. When the request matches a skill above, or the user names one, read it
   with `{{ skill_tool }}` before doing anything else.
2. Follow what it says.{% if bash_tool %} Run its scripts and commands with
   `{{ bash_tool }}`.{% endif %}

3. Never guess what a skill contains: if you have not read it, you do not
   know what it does.
</how_to_use>
</SKILLS>
{% endif %}
